# suite TSOACCPT acceptance and releas
ok 1 - an incomplete draft is refused
ok 2 - the whole blocker list comes back, not one fault
ok 3 - missing commercial fields are reported as SOA0002
ok 4 - an order with no lines has no demand to accept
ok 5 - a complete order has no blockers left
ok 6 - the retention of title position is read back
ok 7 - an ineligible item blocks acceptance
ok 8 - the item blocker carries reason SOA0003
ok 9 - a missing price source or VAT code is SOA0004
ok 10 - a draft order cannot be released
ok 11 - AC-042 a print request is a warning, not a release
ok 12 - the print is reported with 04, never 00
ok 13 - AC-042 the order is still on credit hold
ok 14 - an uncleared deposit is reported for review
ok 15 - nothing is counted as received until it clears
ok 16 - the whole requested deposit is outstanding
1..16
# TSOACCPT acceptance and releas passed 00016 failed 00000
# exit 0
